-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)]"> <p class="mb-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.13em] text-sea-dark">Service area</p> <h1 class="max-w-[860px] text-page-title font-black leading-[1.1] tracking-[-.035em]">Local cleaning across the Space Coast.</h1> <p class="max-w-[700px] text-lede mt-[18px]">Cleaning for homes, vacation rentals, moves, and workspaces in the Brevard County communities listed below.</p> </div> </section> <section class="py-12 max-mobile:py-10"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)]"> <ul class="my-4 grid list-none grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr))] gap-4 p-0 text-[1.1rem] max-mobile:grid-cols-2 max-mobile:gap-x-5 max-mobile:gap-y-0 font-bold"> <li class="border-b border-line py-4">Cocoa</li><li class="border-b border-line py-4">Cocoa Beach</li><li class="border-b border-line py-4">Cape Canaveral</li><li class="border-b border-line py-4">Merritt Island</li><li class="border-b border-line py-4">Rockledge</li><li class="border-b border-line py-4">Melbourne</li><li class="border-b border-line py-4">Palm Bay</li><li class="border-b border-line py-4">Viera</li><li class="border-b border-line py-4">Titusville</li><li class="border-b border-line py-4">Nearby areas by request</li> </ul> <div class="mt-8 border-t border-line pt-8"> <h2>Choose the cleaning you need.</h2> <p class="mt-4 max-w-[760px]">Explore what’s included in each service before requesting a quote.</p> <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-tablet:grid-cols-1"> <div> <h3>Homes &amp; moves</h3> <p class="mt-3">Recurring home cleaning, deep cleaning, and empty-property move cleans.</p> <a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-control-gap text-link font-[750] text-sea-dark underline underline-offset-4 mt-3" href="/residential-cleaning/">Explore home cleaning<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a> </div><div> <h3>Vacation rentals</h3> <p class="mt-3">Turnover cleaning between guest stays, with linen and restocking needs agreed in advance.</p> <a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-control-gap text-link font-[750] text-sea-dark underline underline-offset-4 mt-3" href="/vacation-rental-cleaning/">Explore rental turnovers<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a> </div><div> <h3>Offices &amp; workspaces</h3> <p class="mt-3">Cleaning for offices and workspaces, with a checklist and schedule agreed before the first visit.</p> <a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-control-gap text-link font-[750] text-sea-dark underline underline-offset-4 mt-3" href="/commercial-cleaning/">Explore commercial cleaning<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="border-y border-white/10 bg-ocean text-white py-9 max-mobile:py-8"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)] grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-center max-tablet:grid-cols-1 gap-6"> <div> <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-cyan"><span class="h-px w-10 bg-cyan" aria-hidden="true"></span>Next step</p> <h2 class="max-w-[720px] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-.035em] text-white text-[clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.5rem)]">Not sure if you&#39;re in range?</h2> <p class="mt-4 max-w-[680px] text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.65] text-white/70">Send your town or ZIP code and preferred dates, or call us. We’ll confirm coverage and availability before booking.</p> </div> <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 max-mobile:w-full max-mobile:[&>*]:grow"> <a href="/quote/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-control-gap rounded-lg border no-underline transition-[transform,background,border-color] duration-200 motion-safe:not-disabled:hover:-translate-y-0.5 motio